  "limitations": [
    "GitHub OIDC proves the isolated attestation workflow identity; the producer result remains a statement from repository code.",
    "The epoch-16 artifact syntax is an evidence transport only and confers no release authority.",
    "cargo-deny and RustSec acquisition still require network availability, but exact size and SHA-256 identities are checked before either input is installed or executed.",
